      "respond": {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "The party reaches Greyhollow Ford as the light goes amber. Tamsin Vale, Brother Odo and Kestrel came to cross before full dark, and the ferry keeper owes Tamsin a crossing. The ferry sits chained to the near bank, the ferry-house door hangs open, and the bell that should have rung for them stays silent. Above, in the loft, a board creaks: Wenna Marsh, the keeper, is somewhere overhead and has not called down. Where do you start?"
      }
    },
